## Playbook: retro

PHASE 0 — Session Analysis (Internal)
- Review the full session; list key insights (successes, failures, actionable lessons).

PHASE 1 — Lesson Distillation & Abstraction
- Filter to durable, universal principles; categorize to Global vs Project Doctrine.

PHASE 2 — Doctrine Integration
- Prefer project-level rules first; refine existing rules or add new ones to integrate the lessons.

PHASE 3 — Final Report
- Doctrine update summary with diff, plus session learnings list. If none, state informational notice.

